go-to: @end_of_congress

March on in the workers' united front!

While the right and far left both do voice some concerns, this is acceptable to all factions.

@pragmatic
choose-if: kautsky = 1 or reform = 1 and revolutionary_socialism = 0
subtitle: This will strengthen the <span style="color: #ef5b5d;">**Reformists**</span> and <span style="color: #c564ef;">**Radical Liberals**</span>. This will anger the <span style="color: #b20002;">**Communists**</span>, <span style="color: #a3166b;">**Marxists**</span> and <span style="color: #330000;">**Libertarians**</span>. This will enable the integration of the <span style="color: #bf353a;">**center left**</span> and maybe even unification with the <span style="color: #ea2cdd;">**Progressive Party**</span>.
unavailable-subtitle: We chose to commit ourselves to the revolution.
on-arrival: reformist_strength += 10; radlib_strength += 10; communist_dissent += 10; marxist_dissent += 10; libertarian_strength += 10; pragmatic = 1
go-to: @end_of_congress

If we want to produce real long lasting change, we have to cooperate with the political right. This is the final straw for most of the left of our party.

**If we play our cards right, we will be able to integrate the <span style="color: #bf353a;">center left</span> into our party. If we choose a Radical Liberal route, we may even unite with the <span style="color: #ea2cdd;">Progressive Party</span>!

@end_of_congress
new-page: false

Our congress has come to an end. The results will become clear in a few days.

In spite of all quarrels and factionalisms, all participants put aside their differences for one last time and gather to sing our anthem, the Internationale.

Many leave the congress halls with mixed feelings. All are aware of the importance of this day for the future of the <span style="color: #4972af;">**Democracy of Reddit**</span>.

**The faction which has gathered the most strength will consolidate control over the party. If a left faction consolidates power, we will have another power struggle to determine our path once and for all.**
